  "description": "An oriental period romance about 'Aeri', who came to the battlefield to spend three nights in order to become the wife of King Ye, the leader of the Hongra Army, and reunited with 'Ha Mu-jin', who she had a connection with when she was young, and who eventually finds true love through all kinds of adversity.\n\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11821038)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11821026)",
